  [1mThe fork:[0m whether [38;5;153muserId[39m is an [3minput[0m the caller already knows, or an [3moutput[0m the login produces. That changes who is
  responsible for identity and whether the signature change is even the right move.

  - [1mCaller supplies it[0m — [38;5;153mlogin(userId, username, password)[39m. Cheapest; matches your request literally. But something
